Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.39,0:01:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Langkah Akrobat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Doppellusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.64,0:01:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penginjak Bayang!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dice Thrust!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kritikal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk mengalahkannya,\Naku harus melempar tiga batu sihir lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.64,0:02:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, penyembuhan otomatis Master\Nitu sangat cepat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.15,0:02:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau sampai memakan waktu,\Njelas akan gagal total.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.73,0:02:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang benar saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.11,0:02:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di posisi seperti ini, harusnya\NSylph Cutter tidak akan ditembakkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Percuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak bisa kuhindari!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kesadaranku memudar...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Denyut jantungku kencang sekali...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakiku tidak bertenaga...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Status abnormal, stun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.67,0:03:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mengerti.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.36,0:03:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Stun di situasi seperti ini sangatlah fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.55,0:03:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin karena poin keberuntungan awalku\Nmemang rendah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.45,0:04:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harusnya aku minta Ruche tetap di sini saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Elymas, ayo kita kalahkan berdua!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih banyak sudah percaya padaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.21,0:04:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Doppellusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sedang apa kamu ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seharusnya kamu sedang membawa\Nmereka berdua kabur!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jalannya cuma satu arah,\Ntapi tidak ada tanda-tanda kamu muncul.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.29,0:05:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi mereka berdua kuantar\Nsampai tempat yang aman,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}lalu aku pergi melihat situasi sendirian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal bilang akan segera lari,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kenapa malah kamu lawan habis-habisan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.75,0:05:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.65,0:05:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah tekadku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepatlah mundur, Ruche.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.98,0:05:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga mau bersikeras untuk tetap di sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan kamu pungut.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pungutlah sendiri\Napa yang sudah kamu sebar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anak kecil pun bisa melakukan itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menggelikan sekali menyebut hadiah perpisahan\Nuntuk sesuatu yang kamu buang di tanah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sudah menolongku...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mempertaruhkan nyawa\Nuntuk melindungiku agar bisa kabur.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.59,0:05:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong urus mereka berdua!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.49,0:06:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu juga bilang membutuhkan kekuatanku!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mana bisa orang seperti itu kubiarkan mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tekadku cuma buat kabur,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku sudah lama berhenti jadi petualang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.95,0:06:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, satu-satunya teknik seranganku\Nsudah tidak mempan lagi padanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku dan Ruche tidak punya\Nskill jarak jauh yang bisa mengenainya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.75,0:06:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu mau menyerah begitu saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski diriku yang terus berdalih\Nkalau aku ini tidak berguna,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.55,0:06:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bukankah Elymas tetap\Nmau mengandalkanku?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tenang saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.35,0:06:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ruche...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.81,0:06:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ruche, aku membutuhkanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.98,0:07:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong andalkan aku sekali lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.09,0:07:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Doppellusion sudah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.06,0:07:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata, Ruche jauh melampaui...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.93,0:07:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong, Ruche!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.56,0:07:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku butuh kekuatanmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo kita berdua taklukkan Embryo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.33,0:07:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo lakukan, Elymas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.97,0:09:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka menyerang, Elymas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.31,0:09:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shield Bash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ruche!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.99,0:09:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, aku bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:09:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bisa melakukannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.43,0:10:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Ini tidak ada habisnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.76,0:10:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada gunanya\Nmengalahkan Kesatria Kaleng.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.09,0:10:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau sampai berlarut-larut,\Nkesempatan menang kita akan hilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.78,0:10:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus menyerang tubuh asli Embryo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.65,0:10:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu ada rencana?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau ditanya ada, sebenarnya ada.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seranglah dia dengan Dice Thrust milikmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau sampai gagal, tamatlah riwayat kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.29,0:10:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Peluangnya satu banding enam,\Nkita cuma bisa bertaruh pada keberuntunganmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.80,0:10:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Zirah daging Embryo itu
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:10:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}punya daya pertahanan 88\Nsaat matanya tertutup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.43,0:11:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dapat kritikal dari Dice Thrust\Nyang bisa menembus
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.52,0:11:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}daya pertahanan Raana Emas sebesar 200,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.19,0:11:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pasti bisa memberikan\Ndampak besar secara paksa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seharusnya bisa mengalahkan Embryo\Ntanpa melalui cara yang semestinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ta-Tapi, bagaimana caranya aku bisa\Nsampai ke ketinggian dia?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Langkah Akrobat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.84,0:11:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu hanya akan membuatmu jadi\Nsasaran empuk Sylph Cutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.31,0:11:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Te-Terus bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.02,0:11:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan mendekat dengan paksa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.69,0:11:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ruche ikuti dari belakangku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau itu berhasil,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.57,0:11:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku akan menerbangkan tubuhmu\Nke udara memakai Shield Bash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:12:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanya saja, risikonya terlalu besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.03,0:12:06.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau gagal, nyawa kita berdua\Ntidak akan selamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berharap pada angka enam Dice Thrust, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.10,0:12:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tidak ada cara lain,\Nkita hanya bisa mengharapkan itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kulakukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.21,0:12:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pasti akan mengeluarkan angka enam!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.98,0:12:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong, ya, Ruche!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.61,0:12:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan berharap pada keberuntunganmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tebasan Vital!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ruche, sekarang!\NLompat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shield Bash!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejauh ini masih sempurna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sisanya cuma bisa berdoa\Npada Dewi Keberuntungan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Miss.\N- Saat melawan Raana Emas yang kedua.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.43,0:13:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ruche yang punya keberuntungan tinggi,\Ntujuh kali beruntun gagal dapat angka enam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tahu kalau itu anomali\Nyang tidak berarti apa pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.23,0:13:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.35,0:13:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Peluangnya akan makin mengerucut!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.86,0:13:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dice Thrust!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kesempatannya cuma sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dice Thrust!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kesempatannya cuma sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.77,0:13:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.54,0:14:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gagal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski sudah tidak ada cara lain,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}harusnya aku tak mengambil pilihan\Nuntuk bertaruh nyawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Situasi seperti ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.72,0:14:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana cara mengatasinya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak boleh menyerah di sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.98,0:14:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Paling tidak agar Ruche\Nbisa selamat mendarat,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.90,0:14:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku harus mengalihkan Kesatria Kaleng!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Langkah Akrobat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.17,0:15:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini baru...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dice Thrust yang benar-benar terakhir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mendapat 2.117 poin pengalaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Telah naik ke level 39.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.38,0:15:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku telah melakukan satu kesalahan besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.02,0:15:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Telah naik ke level 41.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.91,0:16:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hanya bisa berdoa\Npada keberuntungan Ruche.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.49,0:16:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sedangkan Ruche,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.82,0:16:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}meraih kemenangan dengan tangannya sendiri\Nmeski keberuntungan sudah tidak memihak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berhasil dikalahkan.\NAku benaran berhasil?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ruche.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.59,0:16:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pasti sudah mati kalau tidak ada dirimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.69,0:16:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sangat berterima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.19,0:16:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jadi merasa sangat percaya diri\Ndari penjelajahan dungeon ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku selalu diberi tahu\Nkalau kelasku ini tidak berguna,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.99,0:16:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi kita berhasil dapat banyak item!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dice Thrust milikku juga—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, bukan karena itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:17:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena Ruche sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.00,0:17:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayang sekali Cline malah\Nmelakukan hal bodoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.93,0:17:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di dunia ini, aku juga terus\Nmelihat orang dari kelas dan levelnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dalam hal itu, artinya aku tidak ada\Nbedanya dengan ayahku atau Cline.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.59,0:17:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang beda dari mereka\Nhanya standar penilaian saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dalam situasi yang taruhannya nyawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.40,0:17:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ruche rela kembali demi menolongku\Nyang keras kepala.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.57,0:17:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, reaksi instannya mampu\Nmembalikkan keadaan ekstrem
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.33,0:17:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan berhasil mengalahkan Embryo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sangat menghargai balas budi
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan bisa mengeluarkan kekuatan\Ndi atas kemampuannya pada saat krusial.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ada rekan yang bisa diandalkan\Nlebih dari dia?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:17:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, pujianmu itu sangat berlebihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.81,0:18:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar Elymas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.65,0:18:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mendapat julukan Pengacau Estimasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukti telah mengalahkan Master dengan grup
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}berisi dua orang atau kurang,\Ndan level tak melebihi 70% rekomendasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat bertarung melawan musuh\Ndengan level lebih tinggi,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.16,0:18:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}daya serang dan kecepatan\Nakan ditambah sebesar 15%.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.79,0:18:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Julukan yang bisa didapat\Ndengan membasmi Master saat berlevel rendah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.18,0:18:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena ini julukan wajib di Magic World,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.01,0:18:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku memang berniat\Nuntuk mendapatkannya suatu saat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata malah dapat di tahap secepat ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.81,0:18:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada item!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.31,0:18:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pedang Kaleng!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yay, hore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.86,0:18:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.32,0:18:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pedang Kaleng, level 35.\NDaya serang +9.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harga pasar: 2,4 juta Gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pedang Kesatria Kaleng.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.33,0:19:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa-bisanya item mahal\Ndrop semudah itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.25,0:19:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pemilik Skill Tree Hoki Gila\Nmanfaatnya memang besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanya saja, aku harus memberanikan diri\Nbuat berjalan sambil memakainya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.97,0:19:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begini, aku jadi ingin berharap\Ndari drop yang dikeluarkan Embryo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ruche, ada busur dengan skill\Nmemberi elemen angin yang jatuh tidak?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.48,0:19:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Busur, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.81,0:19:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kurang tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu barang yang dijatuhkan Embryo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang tidak akan semudah itu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skill Book?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.57,0:19:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Drop Skill Book yang peluangnya\Njauh lebih langka dari senjata?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.71,0:19:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah begitu, ini Sihir Angin Menengah\Nyang mudah digunakan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejak awal memang wajar\Nkalau Skill Book itu berharga,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.01,0:20:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi di dunia ini harganya makin meroket\Nkarena monopoli bangsawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harganya pasti luar biasa mahal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.22,0:20:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa, Elymas?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sampai menyembunyikan item begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.48,0:20:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.65,0:20:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita dapat sesuatu yang luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kali ini nyawa kita bisa benaran diincar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.99,0:20:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hanya bisa menjual ini\Ndi tempat nenek tua itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.09,0:20:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Elymas, apa maksudnya ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak usah cemas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dungeon ini hanya lenyap\Nkarena masternya telah dikalahkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.35,0:20:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanti tahu-tahu sudah berdiri di luar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benarkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku terkejut.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.69,0:20:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak sekali pengalaman baruku dari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.57,0:20:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harusnya ini tidak kukatakan sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.57,0:20:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.61,0:21:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hasil kita kali ini melebihi 60 juta Gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.91,0:21:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu cuma hitungan kasar,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi baru kemungkinan saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.59,0:21:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Ruche, kamu tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ruche, kamu kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ha-Harusnya memang tidak dikatakan sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.33,0:23:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami berhasil mengalahkan Embryo\Nberkat Ruche.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia memang rekan yang sangat hebat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.29,0:23:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan ini, Skill Book Taring Bara Kegilaan\Nyang jadi tujuan awal sudah makin dekat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.80,0:23:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau bisa mengumpulkan sedikit lagi,\N50 juta Gold bukan lagi mimpi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.59,0:23:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanya saja, lawannya nenek tamak itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.01,0:23:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apakah bisa lancar?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya, Negosiasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.14,0:23:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebelum itu, ayo berpesta merayakan\Nkeberhasilan penaklukan dungeon!
